    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "14 GRAND PRIORY, HEADFORT ROAD, KELLS, CO. MEATH.\r\nA fantastic 4 bed detached property now on the market with \r\nHugh Morris Alliance Auctioneers.\r\n\r\nGrand Priory is a prestigious development located off the Headfort Road in Kells  - walking distance to Kells town and the award winning Headfort Golf Club. \r\nLocated in a quiet cul de sac, no 14 is a beautifully presented 4 bed detached home extending to c. 138sqm / 1485 sqft. The internal accommodation is well proportioned throughout.\r\nThis property is not to be missed, contact our office to arrange your viewing!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:  \r\nA welcoming entrance hall featuring tiled flooring, coving and alarm panel. \r\n\r\nSitting room:  \r\nA bright & spacious living room with wooden flooring, coving, a feature bay window, tv point, and solid fuel open fireplace.\r\n\r\nStudy:  \r\nBay window, wooden flooring, Tv point. Currently use as ground floor bedroom, home office or study. \r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining room: \r\nOpen plan kitchen and dining room tiled flooring throughout.  contemporary fitted kitchen overlooking the rear garden, complete with integrated appliances, tiled splash back. Slide door providing access to the back garden. \r\n\r\nUtility:  \r\nLocated off the kitchen, with  tiled flooring, fitted storage unit, integrated appliances, and access to the rear garden. \r\n\r\nGuest WC: \r\nComprising tile flooring , WHB and WC. \r\n\r\nLanding:  \r\nWith carpet flooring, hot-press located off. \r\n\r\nMaster bedroom:  \r\nGenerous front facing double bedroom featuring a bay window, carpet flooring, build in wardrobe and tv point. En-suite located off, includes a corner shower, wc, whb & vanity unit.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \r\nSpacious rear facing double bedroom with wooden flooring, built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: \r\nDouble bedroom to rear of property, with wooden flooring and built in wardrobes and coving.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: \r\nSingle room to the front, with wooden flooring and build in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nMain bathroom:  \r\nTiled  flooring. Bath, wc, whb and vanity unit.\r\n\r\nOutside: \r\nLocated in a cul de sac position, the property boasts a large cobblelock driveway with ample parkin. Gated side entrances lead to a good size south facing rear garden, partially lawn and patio surrounded by shrubbery beds. Useful garden shed also provided. \r\n\r\nServices: \r\nOFCH heating system, mains water & sewage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Beautifully presented 4 bed detached property\r\nPrestigious location\r\nAccommodation extending to c 138sqm/ 1485sqft  \r\nPrivate south facing garden to rear\r\nOutside tap \r\nLarge shed \r\nLarge cobblelcock front drive with ample parking\r\nLocated in a quiet cul de sac"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C2"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Location: \r\nGrand Priory is a prestigious development located off Headfort Road, Kells.  A stones throw to Kells town centre and the award winning Headfort Golf Course. Kells has a wide range of amenities and facilities including Supervalu, Aldi, café’s, restaurants, schools (primary & secondary) and sporting facilities — all within easy reach from Grand Priory. \r\n\r\nFor those commuting, 2 minute drive takes you to the M3 motorway and a 35 minute commute to Blanchardstown and the M50 interchange. The town is also serviced by a regular bus service to Dublin city, Dublin Airport as well as surrounding area’s."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "All viewings are arranged strictly by prior appointment only — contact our office to arrange."
      }
    ],
